      "receiptId": "cumberland-sand-cake.html-1",
      "receiptSource": "The original source of this receipt isn\u0027t known. Can you help? \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:editor@foodsofengland.co.uk?subject=Foods%20of%20England,%20Cumberland%20Sand%20Cake\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Eeditor@foodsofengland.co.uk\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E",
      "receiptText": "2 oz butter\u003Cbr\u003E\n4 oz caster sugar\u003Cbr\u003E\n2 beaten eggs\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 oz plain flour\u003Cbr\u003E\n4 oz cornflour\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 teaspoon baking powder\u003Cbr\u003E\nPinch salt\u003Cbr\u003E\nPinch grated nutmeg\u003Cbr\u003E\n2 teaspoons lemon juice\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nCream the butter and sugar, add eggs and beat well. Fold in the sieved flour, corn flour, baking powder, salt and nutmeg. Add lemon juice and mix well. Bake at 350 deg F for 15 minutes. Dredge top with icing sugar.\u003Cbr\u003E"
    }
